OL,3,A'Public have heard enough from Russell
OL,4,ABrand', says PM's spokesman
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsked if Brand's YouTube channel should
OL,7,Fbe closed by Google, Andy Burnham's
OL,8,Fspokesperson said he believed Brand's
OL,9,Fvictims "now deserve peace from him"
OL,10,Fand "we hope and trust they will do the
OL,11,Fright thing".
